### TaskNest API requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension: click "Send Request" above each block)
@base = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@slug = demo-team

### 1. Log in as the demo user (copy accessToken from the response into @token below)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@tasknest.app", "password": "password123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. Who am I?
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Projects in the workspace
GET {{base}}/w/{{slug}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Board for project WEB
GET {{base}}/w/{{slug}}/projects/WEB/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Create a task
POST {{base}}/w/{{slug}}/projects/WEB/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Try the REST Client", "priority": "high", "dueDate": "2026-12-01" }

### 6. One task with subtasks
GET {{base}}/w/{{slug}}/tasks/WEB-6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Move a task to In progress (top of the column)
PATCH {{base}}/w/{{slug}}/tasks/WEB-7/move
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "in_progress" }

### 8. Search
GET {{base}}/w/{{slug}}/search?q=schema
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. My tasks
GET {{base}}/w/{{slug}}/my-tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Comment on a task
POST {{base}}/w/{{slug}}/tasks/WEB-5/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Sent from VS Code" }
